{
 "name": "dolphin_costume",
 "description": "Doug's grey felt bottlenose dolphin suit for UPRIGHT poses (float, stand, wave): anchor = Doug's hips, list after Doug at the same x/y/scale. Grey suit with darker back side, pale belly panel, stitching and zipper; curved felt dorsal fin rising behind the head to (-176,-282), clear of the cap; flipper mitts on the suit sides; tail stock and dark flukes out of the lower back to (-240,+140). Grey hood: C round the back of the head and under the chin, a melon over the cap dome (blowhole) and a short beak with a mouth line and eye jutting forward above the brim. For swim1/swim2 use dolphin_costume_swim (same suit, laid along the swim lean).",
